Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:11.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why are you the only one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fu's cover song,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:16.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Tokage's gambling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:18.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko's cooking,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and your mukbang...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:22.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Since your solo content's been gaining steam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.96,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,it's time to put more effort \Ninto videos with everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.59,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I-I feel ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:29.00,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sorry. They're all out at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Out, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:33.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Even though {\i1}I{\i0} pulled an all-nighter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,to finish my editing work \Nin time for today's shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:38.35,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well, you know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:38.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.97,0:00:40.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Do you not care?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:43.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You think you're hot stuff because\N your solo vids are doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:44.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Get real!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.34,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sorry—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:46.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've had it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:48.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're not getting my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:49.47,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:51.05,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Don't abandon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:53.19,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:53.19,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:57.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then go take a trip here by yourselves!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tra-Pickle Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:01.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs26\shad1\bord2\fnArial Black\frz-0.39\c&H5543F1&\4c&H5543F1&\3c&HE1F0FE&\pos(333.5,59.5)}A Must for This Summer!\NDesert Island Booking Plan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:01.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs26\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\frz-0.39\c&HC37346&\4c&H5543F1&\3c&HFFFFF3&\pos(411.5,143.5)}Tra-Pickle Island
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:01.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\shad1\bord2\fnArial Black\frz-0.39\c&H5543F1&\4c&HCA7448&\3c&HE1F0FE&\pos(410,221)}Whole Island Rental!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:01.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\bord2\frz-0.39\c&HC37346&\4c&H5543F1&\3c&HFFFFF3&\pos(410.5,270.5)}A once-in-a-lifetime memory!\NWant to experience\Nthe ultimate adventure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:01.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\bord2\c&HC37346&\4c&H5543F1&\3c&HFFFFF3&\frz7.62\pos(189.5,284)}Highlights of\NTra-Pickle Island
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.06,0:01:01.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A one-week desert island survival challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:03.03,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:04.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,1)\bord2\pos(270,207.5)}Normally, you need special permission\Nto film on a desert island
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:07.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You'll be taking care of all the \Nplanning and filming by yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,so bring me back a proper video!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:10.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:12.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey! Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:18.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What even goes into a proper video?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:53.15,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3E2D02&}Blood-or-Die! Desert Island Survival
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.36,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,The ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:56.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,The sandy beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.69,0:02:58.94,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,A desert island!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:02.82,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with that attitude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.62,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Another thousand yen and I would have had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:08.18,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Why'd I get dragged out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:10.75,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I was in the middle of my shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:14.24,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And I was in the middle of shopping for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:18.27,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But now that we're here, \Nwe might as well enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.97,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,L-Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,All eyes on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:27.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(231,1)\fs26\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H80878C&\3c&H58345D&\pos(246,71)}MayoPan's\N{\c&H874E4D&\3c&HC6A099&\fs20}One-Week Desert Island\NSurvival Challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:27.35,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This is MayoPan's one-week \Ndesert island survival challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:32.14,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,554)\fs26\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H9F9697&\3c&H90598B&\pos(326.5,79)}MayoPan's\N{\c&H874E4D&\3c&HC6A099&\fs20}One-Week Desert Island\NSurvival Challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:33.10,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here's the agenda for day one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.10,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(528,1)\fs32\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H9F9697&\3c&H90598B&\pos(522.5,19.5)}Day One
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.10,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(528,1)\fs22\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H886127&\3c&HC29A95&\pos(430.5,58)}Set up camp\NStart a fire\NCollect drinking water
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,478)\fs32\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H9F9697&\3c&H90598B&\pos(522.5,19.5)}Day One
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(1,478)\fs22\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H886127&\3c&HC29A95&\pos(430.5,58)}Set up camp\NStart a fire\NCollect drinking water
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:35.92,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Leveling the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.77,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Gathering flotsam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:40.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Breaking a sweat putting up a tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:43.24,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Getting blisters while using a hand drill friction,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:45.85,Default,Live,0,0,0,,until at last, we start a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:49.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Exploring the area until \Nwe find potable water!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:51.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Collecting and boiling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.37,0:03:52.50,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.02,0:03:54.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Day two!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:58.56,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,Struggling to catch fish in the water to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:59.04,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,A perfect set of plans, as proper as can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:03:59.93,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:02.01,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Come back, Masaki's blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:03.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:08.14,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,393)\fs20\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H4A312D&\3c&HB5847A&}The End
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:04.75,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:07.18,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Do we really gotta do all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:08.56,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I wanna take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:09.49,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:11.92,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama spent good time planning this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.29,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.04,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:17.22,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Surviving on a desert island in swimsuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:20.85,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This is guaranteed to rake in the clicks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:22.40,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And if we strike it rich...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.41,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You can play all the\N pachinko and slots you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.39,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Or sing all you want with a pro live band!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.15,0:04:32.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Or, er... eat all the snacks you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:35.77,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Let's do this, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:39.94,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,A perfect motivational speech, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:55.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs20\pos(320,40)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:43.92,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,262)\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(320,230)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Day 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:46.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.00,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:48.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:49.92,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:50.81,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:53.00,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.36,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko, Tokage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.36,0:04:55.19,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.55,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Aye aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:59.61,Default,Live,0,0,0,,As of today...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:04.75,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We'll be starting a one-week, \Ngirls-only desert island survival challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.75,0:05:08.29,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,And of course, it'll be survival in the \Ndead of night, the MayoPan way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:11.31,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Let's get down to business \Nwith our plans for the first day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:14.00,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Today, we'll be setting up camp using flotsam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:16.58,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I can build anything, \Nfrom a castle to a log cabin—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:17.87,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This will be our home base!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:20.62,Default,Live,0,0,0,,There's plenty of space, \Nand it should be easy to level out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:22.59,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Perfect for setting up camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:23.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:25.58,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We've got a lot of work ahead \Nstarting from day one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:26.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's get pumped up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:28.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:30.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wonder if that's what they're \Nsaying right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Man, TSUMA-shi's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:39.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,His editing here is so slick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:42.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Night-vision mode works better than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:45.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:51.08,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Boy, flotsam is pretty hard to find, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:55.13,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, right now, everyone else \Nis preparing to set up camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:56.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:57.71,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:01.60,Default,Live,0,0,0,,A tarp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:04.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Just what we need to protect us \Nfrom the rain and wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:05.89,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wait, there's driftwood here as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:06.47,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:08.59,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,200)\fs14\c&H96CB92&\3c&H37554C&}Tomatoes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:08.59,Default,Live,0,0,0,,A can and a plastic bottle, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:11.24,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Awesome, no punctures!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.00,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We can use this to collect water,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:14.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,and cook on the campfire with this can,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:16.98,Default,Live,0,0,0,,and even make salt from seawater!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:19.14,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The perfect find for some peace of mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,With that, I've got what I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:23.15,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Time to head back to base!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:31.43,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs20\pos(320,40)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.97,0:06:26.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:29.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm dying here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:39.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The more shots, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:39.19,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs20\pos(320,40)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:42.66,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:44.67,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:46.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The hell's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:48.70,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,The perfect base, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:51.00,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,It's DIY! D-I-Y!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:52.98,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You really built a house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:54.35,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What happened to survival?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:57.72,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Live-sama, I made sure to get all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:03.48,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Heave-ho, heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:09.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I think you've exceeded the\N limits of human ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.81,0:07:12.61,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:14.08,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:16.87,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,turned into {\i1}this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.15,0:07:19.09,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,All my hard work...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.75,Default,Live,0,0,0,,All right, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:22.92,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Let's go all out and start this fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.17,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:26.82,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The struggle to start a fire \Nis what matters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:29.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Even survival pros can take hours just to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:35.09,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You can start a fire in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.09,0:07:36.08,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.02,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Not if you're human, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.02,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Live-sama, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:43.77,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Fu, you get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:46.52,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:48.04,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko, the dry grass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:49.22,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Here, dry grass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:50.03,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:53.16,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Dang, you're a real natural, Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:07:59.66,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.29,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I forgot to press record.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:09.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What a slow trickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.42,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Slow as molasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:11.78,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Slow and steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:13.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Listen, people want to see—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:16.55,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,If we crack this baby open, \Nthe water'll come shooting out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:18.93,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Pun—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:22.13,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You know you can't just punch \Na rock in half, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:24.31,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:26.94,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,1)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H7187AB&\3c&H06187D&\pos(368.5,64)}Tomatoes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:29.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, let's start boiling this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:33.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why are you drinking it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.07,0:08:33.71,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:35.70,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You need to boil the water before drinking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:38.17,Default,Live,0,0,0,,If you were human, \Nyou'd be in for a {\i1}really{\i0} bad time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:39.76,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But I'm a vampire—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:40.79,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.08,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Tee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:45.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fscx90\bord1.5\fnArial Black\3c&H2200B3&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(486.5,125.5)}Instead of Drinking {\c&HE3A353&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Water,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:45.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\3c&H2200B3&\pos(303,181.5)}We Ate Only
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:45.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3.5\fs36\fscx90\fscy110\fnArial Black\t(483,733,\frz-2)\t(1609,1860,\frz-5)\move(302.5,198.5,295.5,198.5,2610,3236)\c&H1F6E11&\3c&H1F6E11&}Watermelon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.08,0:08:45.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs36\fscx90\fscy110\fnArial Black\t(483,733,\frz-2)\t(1609,1860,\frz-5)\move(302.5,198.5,295.5,198.5,2610,3236)\c&H1F6E11&\3c&HFFFFFF&}W{\c&H76ED33&}a{\c&H1F6E11&}t{\c&H76ED33&}e{\c&H1F6E11&}r{\c&H76ED33&}m{\c&H1F6E11&}e{\c&H76ED33&}l{\c&H1F6E11&}o{\c&H76ED33&}n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:45.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs28\bord3\shad2\fnArial Black\c&H2200B3&\3c&H2200B3&\4c&H2200B3&\pos(309.5,319.5)}For 1 Whole Week
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.08,0:08:45.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs28\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H2200B3&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(309.5,319.5)}For 1 Whole Week
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:50.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Managed to get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:53.34,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H6D6D67&\pos(279,193.5)}Back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:53.34,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs16\c&HF0F3F1&\pos(381.5,193.5)\3c&HE9855D&}Publish
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I wonder how they're all doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.52,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not that I'm expecting much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:03.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Whatever. Time for a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.52,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.35,0:09:16.92,Default,Live,0,0,0,,They sure are a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:20.53,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,763)\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(320,230)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Day 2
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:22.54,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:24.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:36.70,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs20\pos(320,40)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:27.56,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This is day two of life on a desert island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.97,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Today, we're diving into the water \Nto catch some fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:33.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Who will be the first to snag one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:37.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:40.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Where the hell did they go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:43.43,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.68,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,If you don't, then who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:48.19,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You're MayoPan's star singer, Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:50.61,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,S-Star singer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:52.67,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Okay! Take it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:54.23,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Take it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:57.99,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Take it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.20,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Okay, please listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:04.12,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Are ya ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:05.31,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:09.99,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Okay, place yer bets!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.05,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Even on 2-2, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:19.30,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Then I'll go for odd on 4-1!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:20.30,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:22.55,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Even on 2-2?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:25.98,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.39,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Got myself a coconut crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:34.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:09.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Got it! I'm first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:10.35,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:22.02,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:24.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're going way too wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:28.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,There's no way humans could catch a marlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:29.70,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,The bigger the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:30.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:31.56,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:34.36,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Hell, why are we even on this desert island?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:36.50,Default,Live,0,0,0,,To shoot a video, what else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:38.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's do this the right way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:41.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We barely have any usable footage \Nfrom the past two days!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:42.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:44.40,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You two need to take it down a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:46.66,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.85,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You were about to sing, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:50.77,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's not relevant right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.90,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,How sassy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:53.77,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I don't need sass from you, Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.06,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What's {\i1}that{\i0} mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:56.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You're my lackey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:58.40,DefaultTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,Ugh, I'm starving. Time for some blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:58.40,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:00.42,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:01.79,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:02.46,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:03.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.32,0:12:05.78,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,The blood... isn't here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.58,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,We forgot to bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.35,DefaultItalics,Reporter,0,0,0,,Next, we have the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:34.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\fs12\bord2\c&H4A3EC9&\3c&HB4EEF7&\pos(396,49.5)}Typhoon Warning
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:36.51,DefaultItalics,Reporter,0,0,0,,The typhoon that formed in the Philippine Sea \Nyesterday continues to grow stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:39.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,1)\fscx89.21\fscy89.21\t(25,4363,\fscx100\fscy100)\bord1.5\an9\fs20\move(569.43,58.7,599.5,50,25,4363)\c&H563AC3&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Typhoon Warning
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:39.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,1)\fscx89.21\fscy89.21\t(25,4363,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs14\bord2\3c&H2206CC&\move(247.84,62.71,239,54.5,25,4363)}Tra-Pickle Island
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:39.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,1)\fscx89.21\fscy89.21\t(25,4363,\fscx100\fscy100)\fs14\bord2\3c&H2206CC&\move(214.84,167.08,202,171.5,25,4363)}Extremely Strong
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:39.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,1)\fscx89.21\fscy89.21\t(25,4363,\fscx100\fscy100)\bord1\shad1\fs14\c&H563AC3&\move(382.1,232.65,389.5,245,25,4363)}Storm Area
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:39.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,1)\fscx89.21\fscy89.21\t(25,4363,\fscx100\fscy100)\bord1\shad1\fs14\c&H34EEE9&\move(502.08,247.37,524,261.5,25,4363)}Strong Wind Area
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:39.15,DefaultItalics,Reporter,0,0,0,,and is currently passing through \Nthe Tra-Pickle Island region.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:00.87,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Everyone, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:05.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.33,0:13:07.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now then, let's set all this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:15.09,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I want some blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.09,0:13:17.04,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You know we don't have any!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.53,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Well, why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:19.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.15,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I wish I could!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:23.37,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Blood! Where's my blood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:26.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why don't we film today's part for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:28.03,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(320,230)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Day 3
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:32.81,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs20\pos(320,40)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:31.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,T-Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:33.91,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Day three on a desert island!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.79,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Today, we'll be, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:37.08,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:39.45,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm getting outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:48.41,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Too low on blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:50.50,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I know! My phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:51.68,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'll call for help on my phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:53.77,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,No service!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:53.77,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\frz356.4\c&HE8E6FD&\pos(205,155)}No Service
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:56.24,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I need...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.27,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I need to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:03.57,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,The parlor is getting new machines! \NI asked Ichijo-kun to tune the pins!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:06.40,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Chance Akaishi's waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.58,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I know! A raft!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:34.56,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:37.88,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm all out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:40.60,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Blood... I want blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.00,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,If I sing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:46.30,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Even if I sing a song, \NI still can't distract myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:48.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey! It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:51.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm sure Masaki will notice \Nand come to our rescue!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.23,0:14:53.05,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's focus on shooting our video until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:53.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,'Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:58.58,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1023,266)\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(320,230)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Day 4
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:56.76,DefaultTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Live-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:59.08,DefaultTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:11.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:20.85,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,1)\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(320,230)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Day 5
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:54.01,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,767)\fnTimes New Roman\c&H646365&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.5\fs14\frz8.608\fax-0.15\move(492,81.5,437,109.5,23,3193)}Staying Up {\c&H9B506F&}Late\N{\c&H646365&}on a {\c&H7750DA&}Sunday
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:55.76,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,515)\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(320,230)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Day 6
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:07.92,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Tokage's finally gone into \Nlow-energy mode as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:13.03,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(523,1)\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(320,230)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Day 7
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:14.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Lighting, check!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:15.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Camera angle, check!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:17.53,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:20.52,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:23.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:34.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Setup, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:51.14,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,In the end, nothing turned out \Nthe way I planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:55.46,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,But I need to finish the job, at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:17:05.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs20\pos(320,40)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:16:58.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:02.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're finally done with our \Nseven-day survival challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:04.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:09.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We ran into all sorts of \Nmishaps this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:13.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,There's a lot we didn't get around to doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:18.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's think of those as future goals for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:34.67,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs20\pos(320,40)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:20.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Next time, we'll prepare more thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:24.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,For a more perfect time surviving...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:28.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Surviving...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:34.65,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone, until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:42.66,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(320,230)\bord1\blur2\3a&H99&}Day 8
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:42.66,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,The week's up, \Nso why aren't they back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:45.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We still need to record \Ntheir closing remarks—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:48.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:49.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:53.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is their supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:54.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:57.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Does that mean they left this behind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:18:00.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can they go without blood for a week?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:09.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:15.51,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I just wish I could've tasted \NMasaki's blood before the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:18.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:38.83,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:40.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I can go ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:46.38,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,At long last!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:48.85,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I get to drink Masaki's blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:51.61,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Time to dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:55.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:56.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:59.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wh-What are {\i1}you{\i0} doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:03.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What kind of question is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:05.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the ones who forgot to bring the blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.91,0:19:08.32,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Talk about causing trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:09.41,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Shige?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:13.15,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard it is to fly \Nacross the ocean carrying a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:14.79,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:17.33,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Crying won't work on me next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.33,0:19:18.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,H-Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.80,0:19:20.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can you stop making stuff up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You upside-down liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:25.39,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're the one who was crying \Nabout how they might be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.39,0:19:26.67,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Upside-down or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:28.18,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Gimme some more blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.33,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You already had plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:32.18,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:34.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I-I didn't cry or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:36.49,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hey, now! Wait your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:39.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:45.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:49.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to shoot a proper video at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.34,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm nothing but a failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:53.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:56.00,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I can't show you any of the footage we shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:57.54,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Scrap it! Throw it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:19:58.85,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.85,0:20:00.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I already watched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:03.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Skimmed it, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:05.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why'd you look?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:06.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:07.56,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:11.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Chopping down a tree bare-handed won't fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:15.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but starting the fire in a flash, \Nor drinking untreated water...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:17.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You even managed to put up a tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.49,0:20:18.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.27,0:20:20.41,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But we can't use most of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:23.49,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's totally absurd, not to mention \Nbeyond human ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:26.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,There are plenty of editing tricks \Nwe can use for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:29.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You need material that's entertaining \Nbefore anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:33.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But there was also the marlin, \Nand then the typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:35.42,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Most of the back half is just us half-dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:37.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's just one disaster after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:39.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's wrong with disasters?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:41.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You don't end up half-dead every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:43.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You got real lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:44.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's totally off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.69,0:20:46.97,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You can't make a proper video like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.25,0:20:48.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:49.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:53.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Maybe it didn't go the way you planned it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:20:56.16,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but it shows you all trying your hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:59.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,All of that taken as a whole \Nis what makes for a good video.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:01.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Like the time with the garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:03.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You did a proper good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:06.49,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Then I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:07.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,All good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:10.17,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:12.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I can drink your blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:14.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not what we agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.51,0:21:15.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:21.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Still, looks like you need me \Nin charge after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:23.53,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll need to roll up my sleeves \Nto edit this bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.03,0:21:25.31,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.22,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll help you edit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:29.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can with your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.53,0:21:35.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let me warn you: \NYou need a real good eye for editing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:39.52,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If you half-ass it, I'm calling off that \Npromise about my blood for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:40.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.69,0:21:42.73,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm a real go-getter when it comes to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:48.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Happy to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\an7\c&H141719&\pos(280.5,6.5)}Live\NSent you a sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\c&HFEEFFA&\3c&HDFAAB5&\bord1.5\blur1\pos(449,56)}Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:26.55,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:27.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:28.19,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Can't believe we forgot the blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:28.42,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fs16\c&H373A37&\3c&HF4F6F5&\pos(157,49)}Nearby Residents Concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:28.42,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fs16\c&H373A37&\3c&HF4F6F5&\pos(527,75)}Lives in Vicinity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:28.42,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.5,269)\c&HF7F7F5&\3c&H6A5D66&\4c&H6A5D66&\bord1\shad1}It suddenly collapsed and scared me to death
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:29.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's the most important thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.26,0:23:31.04,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tsk, tsk. That's where you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:31.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.43,0:23:33.22,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The most important thing to me is Masaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:33.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:34.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,...'s blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.33,0:23:35.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It always comes back to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.55,0:23:37.18,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "Ichiko's Wish"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:37.18,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H462A0F&}Ichiko's Wish
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.18,0:23:39.27,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I wanna drink your blood!
